{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","冰风龙卷"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤魔法剑吸引附近敌人向中心聚拢，并造成伤害和定身。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","埃隆将双剑力量合二为一，选择一个地图格，吸引附近2格范围内敌人将其向中心聚拢，短暂延迟后产生爆炸，对2格范围内的敌人造成250% + 20% ATK伤害，并定身3秒。优先选择敌人最密集的区域释放。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":64,"end":70,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":60,"end":74,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":78,"end":80,"tooltip_key":"keyword:immobilize"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至270% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至290% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至310% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至330% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","冰斩风刺"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","分别使用两把剑对范围内敌人造成伤害，并分别降低技能急速和魔法抗性。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","埃隆首先对面前扇形3格范围内的敌人造成110% + 10% ATK伤害，降低其50点急速，持续5秒。随后对目标进行戳刺，对